     ship as _a_r_g_s_._m_d_a___g_i_d.  The name is the expansion of _f_m_t and following ar‐
     guments as printf(9) would print it.  The name determines its path under
     _/_d_e_v or other devfs(5) mount point and may contain slash ‘/’ characters
     to denote subdirectories.  The permissions of the file specified in
     _a_r_g_s_._m_d_a___m_o_d_e are defined in <_s_y_s_/_s_t_a_t_._h>:

