     of type _v_o_i_d _*, and can be initialized simultaneously with the _c_d_e_v allo‐
     cation by filling _a_r_g_s_._m_d_a___s_i___d_r_v_1 and _a_r_g_s_._m_d_a___s_i___d_r_v_2 members of the
